# MQ16 "Light the Dragonfires". MQ15 100 set MQ16 5: the player takes Martin to the Elder Council Chamber (9, 10).
# Chancellor Ocato accepts his claim (14, 15); a messenger brings word of the attack (16 .. 19) and Ocato calls the
# guards (20, 21). The party fights its way out of the Palace (25, 26, 27) into the Temple District (29), where
# Mehrunes Dagon stands (30). Martin has a plan (35); inside the Temple of the One (40) he says farewell (45, 46),
# shatters the Amulet (50) and as the avatar of Akatosh casts Dagon out (54 .. 65, 80). Ocato closes the story
# (100).
# DRAFT from tools/live/quest_brief.py (2026-11-13): not run yet. The two trigger boxes (29, 30) have no names; the
# case goes to the markers beside them and may need a short walk once they are located.

# The ride to the Imperial City is the player's travel with Martin (MQ16MartinFollowPCToPalace): both are placed
# in the Chamber. MQ16Script sets 9 with Martin in ICPalaceElderCouncilChambers and 10 with Martin and the player
# within 600 of MQ16MartinElderCouncilMarker. Ocato's greeting at 10 ("I have been expecting you. ...", INFO
# 000146ED) sets 14; his word to Martin sets 15, the messenger arrives (16) and the exchange runs to 20 and 21.
case mq16_elder_council
until 300 GetStage MQ16 >= 5
defend MartinRef
run
player.moveto MQ16MartinElderCouncilMarker
wait 120
run
MartinRef.moveto player
until 600 GetStage MQ16 >= 10
# Ocato speaks his greeting to the party by himself (a goodbye line: no menu), run 37o.
until 1800 GetStage MQ16 >= 14
until 1800 GetStage MQ16 >= 15
until 1800 GetStage MQ16 >= 16
until 3600 GetStage MQ16 >= 20
until 300 GetStageDone MQ16 21
end

# Out of the Palace: MQ16Script sets 25 when the player has left the Chamber and 26 when Martin has; Martin going
# through MQ16PalaceToTempleDistrictDoor sets 27. In the Temple District the player crosses the trigger boxes that
# set 29 and 30 (Mehrunes Dagon). The fight through the Palace district is the player's, beside Martin.
case mq16_to_temple_district
defend MartinRef
# Martin ESCORTS the player (MQ16MartinEscortPCToTempleDistrict, stages 21 .. 29) and walks only with the player
# beside him (37p, 37q): the player keeps to him, through the one door out of the Chamber
# (ICPalaceInteriorToMQ16ExteriorDoor) and across the Palace district. The checkpoint leaves the player beside
# him and his escort sets off at once; an `approach` then put the player in front of a walking Martin nine times
# in 10 s, and he walked on toward the player, past the trigger planes, into Mehrunes Dagon (fight60 run 2).
follow MartinRef
until 3600 MartinRef.GetInCell ICPalaceElderCouncilChambers == 0
approach MartinRef
until 600 GetStageDone MQ16 25
until 600 GetStageDone MQ16 26
until 7200 GetStageDone MQ16 27
follow
# Martin is through the door by 27 and `follow` leaves the player where his trail stopped (53b). The player goes
# through after him at once: MQ16 makes him mortal, his death is the game over, and with the player 2+ game minutes
# behind (a walk to the door and two waits at test pace) the Temple District daedra killed him alone (58e).
# Joining Martin himself put the player inside the first trigger box he stood in (59f: x 24846; the box is
# 164 thick at x 24790..24955), where no OnTrigger fires; going back to the door after that left him alone
# again (59f replay). So the player comes out of the door's landing side (0004A91E, landing 26348 59330) and
# walks west at once across both planes and past Martin, as a player coming through the door does.
run
player.moveto 0004A91E
wait 10
# The two trigger boxes are thin planes across the way west (TrigZone02 at scale 4, turned 103 degrees): 0000CF24
# (MQ16LeginoAttackTriggerZoneSCRIPT, 29) at x 24873 and 00094167 (MQ16MehrunesDagonTriggerZoneSCRIPT, 30) at x 24264.
# Their centres are above the ground, so the walk goes to a marker on the ground past both.
walk MQ16Gate1SpawnMarker
until 1800 GetStage MQ16 >= 29
until 1800 GetStage MQ16 >= 30
# At 30 Martin comes to the player (MQ16MartinAskPC, a force-greet), so no case boundary here. His greeting
# ("We're too late... Mehrunes Dagon is here!", INFO 000152ED) offers "Can we cast him back into Oblivion?" ->
# "What about the Amulet of Kings?" (INFO 0004BFBD) -> "But you said it was no use..." -> "I'll get you to the
# Temple." (INFO 0004BFBF, 35) -> "Follow me.". With the player and Martin in ICTempleDistrictTempleOfTheOneMQ16
# the script sets 40.
hear 3600 MartinRef too late
wait 30
talk MartinRef
ask "Can we cast him back into Oblivion?"
ask "What about the Amulet of Kings?"
ask "But you said it was no use..."
ask "I'll get you to the Temple."
until 300 GetStage MQ16 >= 35
ask "Follow me."
bye if open
run
player.moveto MQ16MartinWaitInTempleMarker
wait 120
run
MartinRef.moveto player
until 1800 GetStage MQ16 >= 40
end

# In the Temple of the One: Martin reaches his marker (MartinScript OnPackageDone MQ16MartinToTempleWaitMarker: 45)
# and comes to the player with his farewell ("I do what I must do. ...", INFO 0008E11F, a force-greet that sets 46
# by itself, run 37u); he lights the Dragonfires (50), and the end game plays out by itself (54, 58: Martin
# disabled, 60, 65). MQ16Script sets 80 (then 100) 15 s after 65.
# Ocato in the ruined Temple: at 65 he is given MQ16OcatoToTempleEND (a force-greet), so no case boundary here. His
# greeting ("What happened? Where's Martin? ...", INFO 000ADC5C, MQ16 >= 60) offers "Martin is gone." -> "Yes. He
# shattered the Amulet..." -> "...and Martin's blood, too...", which offers "But the gates are sealed." (INFO
# 000ADD45), which offers "What about the Empire?" (INFO 000ADD1E).
# A fight beside the player holds every force-greet until it is over (the Dialogue gate counts the fighters'
# shouts as speakers), and at test pace two zombies (MQ12ZombieRiser01REF / 02REF) fought Jauffre and Baurus
# in the Temple for 5 real minutes while the player stood by (60a): the player takes part, as a player does.
case mq16_dragonfires
defend JauffreRef
until 3600 GetStage MQ16 >= 45
until 1800 GetStageDone MQ16 46
until 3600 GetStage MQ16 >= 50
until 7200 GetStage MQ16 >= 60
until 3600 GetStage MQ16 >= 65
run
000C5B42.kill
000C5B43.kill
hear 3600 OcatoRef What happened
wait 30
talk OcatoRef
ask "Martin is gone."
ask "Yes. He shattered the Amulet..."
ask "...and Martin's blood, too..."
ask "But the gates are sealed."
ask "What about the Empire?"
until 600 GetStageDone MQ16 100
bye if open
end
